          "status"
        ],
        "title": "DependencyStatus",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "DietaryClass": {
        "description": "What the person eats — DB §8.5, FR-M4-035.\n\n🔒 Lives on the *client*, not the plan (DB §5.1): it is a property of the\nperson, and it filters food search at authoring time, before a plan exists.\n\n``JAIN`` is not a stricter vegetarian in a way a boolean could express — it\nexcludes root vegetables, which is a different axis from animal products\nentirely, and collapsing it would put onion in a Jain client's plan.",
        "enum": [
          "vegetarian",
          "eggetarian",
          "non_vegetarian",
          "vegan",
          "jain"
        ],
        "title": "DietaryClass",
        "type": "string"
      },
